        "id": 70781,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-12T16:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If more than 1 hero are tied for something, most cards, most/least hp, etc. Players choose who will be affected from the heroes that fit that description. However, only the number of heroes afected doesn;t change from what the card says. So if the card says the hero with the most cards, you choose 1 hero among the ones with the most cards.</p>",
